  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120, round 5): every front from w01-323s1/s2 (NW, 2025/2021), w02-143s1 (SE, 2025) and w03-233 (SW, 2025): curtain-wall glazing floor to ceiling on six storeys, a dark slab band with a rail at every upper floor line (terraces, 0.9 m deep) and a dark projecting roof canopy (terraces.roof). The set-back top storey and the low SE wing take the curtain-wall scheme as otherWalls.",
